  "description": "The text 'market day' is overlaid on the image. This phrase is commonly used in many cultures to refer to a day when local markets are held, often involving the sale of goods, livestock, or produce. Understanding this phrase requires knowledge of common vernacular and cultural expressions used to describe regular market events. This background knowledge helps interpret the meme as labeling the scene as a typical market day.",
